WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
The shared Workbench shell surrounds the FounderOps operating view.

00:04.400 --> 00:09.400
Sales & Pipeline collapses and expands, showing opportunities and contacts.

00:09.400 --> 00:14.400
Marketing & Campaigns opens its campaign rows.

00:14.400 --> 00:19.400
Operations opens related workflow and task rows.

00:19.400 --> 00:23.400
Work-view search opens, then is dismissed.

00:23.400 --> 00:26.480
The operating view remains within the same Workbench shell.
